{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CguczZxr84qVfuH1fiRTF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01PMSYA18f9bTvCojnxJ958G","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /workspace; cat > agent/CHAMPION <<'EOF'\nsha: 6f1e6cdbb8a45c3c9624b51a941c8d8f8e83e080\nagent_dir: agent\nprofiles: [low, high]\nnotes: |\n  Champion v7 — seasonal (New-York-time weekly profile) HAR-EWMA scale-mixture model: robust\n  (mean-|r|) level from three EWMAs mixed by lead time, calendar event multipliers (CPI, NFP, PPI,\n  retail sales, GDP/PCE, FOMC, earnings), exactly-zero steps and price-grid rounding, Student-t x\n  log-normal per-path mixture, stratified (Latin-hypercube) draws. CPU only, closed form,\n  ~0.1 s per 24h prompt, ~0.03 s per 1h prompt; artifacts agent/profiles.npz + agent/events.json.\n  Official backtester (agent/predict.py = synth-lib backtest, 1000 paths, the validator's own\n  prompt times, the 10 days of scored prompts before 2026-11-08), mean CRPS over assets:\n                  starter (log-normal martingale)   champion v7   change\n    CRYPTO_24H        4606.76                        4436.95       -3.69%  (5 assets, 1200 prompts)\n    COM_EQU_24H       3304.04                        3037.12       -8.08%  (8 assets, 870 prompts)\n    CRYPTO_1H          988.40                         925.40       -6.37%  (5 assets, 7200 prompts)\n  The champion's profiles/event multipliers are fitted on data to 2026-11-08, so that window is\n  in-sample for them. Out-of-sample (walk-forward artifacts fitted before each window), holdout\n  window S never used for any decision (scored 2026-09-05..09-26; 1h 09-23..10-03), mean CRPS:\n    CRYPTO_24H 4148.5 (starter 4284.6, -3.2%), vs the best single field miner -0.01%\n    COM_EQU_24H 1803.6 (starter 2066.0, -12.7%), vs the best single field miner +0.00%\n    CRYPTO_1H 917.2 (starter 959.2, -4.4%), vs the best single field miner -0.16%\n  Details: agent/journal.md, agent/report.md.\nEOF\ngit add -A; git commit -qm \"nominate v7: official numbers vs starter, holdout S results\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\"; head -5 agent/BUDGET.md | tail -3","description":"Update CHAMPION to v7 with official numbers; commit"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":949,"cache_read_input_tokens":409163,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":949,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0c085d9a-8c1d-4329-8588-fab9897b1131","uuid":"762539db-e3f4-4617-8f51-4796e834748f","timestamp":"2026-11-10T17:12:56.176Z"}
