{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgud4sZdEBF6GwmBQHNP3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_018WSk8u6vueu26L4A8aUkY3","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /workspace; uv run python -I - <<'EOF' 2>&1 | grep -v Warn\nimport sys, numpy as np, pandas as pd\nsys.path.insert(0, 'agent')\nimport modeling\nfrom pathlib import Path\nfrom synth_lib.benchmark.generate_predictions import load_minute_prices, context_slice\nt = pd.Timestamp('2026-11-07 14:03', tz='UTC')\ndef check(name, asset, ctx, tl=86400, ti=300, n=1000):\n    try:\n        o = modeling.simulate(asset=asset, start_time=t.isoformat(), time_increment=ti, time_length=tl, num_simulations=n, context_prices=ctx)\n        a = np.asarray(o[2:], dtype=float)\n        ok = a.shape == (n, tl // ti + 1) and np.isfinite(a).all() and (a > 0).all()\n        print(f\"{name:38s} shape {a.shape} finite&positive {ok} first {a[0,0]:.4f}\")\n    except Exception as e:\n        print(f\"{name:38s} EXCEPTION {type(e).__name__}: {e}\")\npr = load_minute_prices(Path('market_data'), 'NVDAX', t - pd.Timedelta(days=21), t)\nctx = context_slice(pr, t, 86400, 21)\ncheck('normal NVDAX 24h', 'NVDAX', ctx)\nc2 = ctx.copy(); c2.iloc[: -3 * 1440] = np.nan; check('only last 3 days real', 'NVDAX', c2)\nc3 = ctx.copy(); c3.iloc[-600:-60] = np.nan; check('9h gap near the end', 'NVDAX', c3)\nc4 = ctx.copy(); c4.iloc[:-20] = np.nan; check('only 20 real minutes', 'NVDAX', c4)\ncheck('unknown asset name', 'FOOBAR', ctx)\ncheck('close Series instead of frame', 'NVDAX', ctx['close'])\ncheck('num_simulations=7', 'NVDAX', ctx, n=7)\ncheck('1h format on an equity', 'NVDAX', ctx, tl=3600, ti=60)\ncheck('odd format 2h/2min', 'NVDAX', ctx, tl=7200, ti=120)\nc5 = ctx.copy(); c5['high'] = np.nan; c5['low'] = np.nan; check('no high/low', 'NVDAX', c5)\nc6 = ctx.copy(); c6.iloc[-1, :] = np.nan; check('last bar NaN', 'NVDAX', c6)\npr2 = load_minute_prices(Path('market_data'), 'BTC', t - pd.Timedelta(days=21), t)\ncheck('BTC 1h', 'BTC', context_slice(pr2, t, 3600, 21), tl=3600, ti=60)\nimport os; os.environ['SYNTH_BENCHMARK_CALENDAR'] = '/nonexistent.parquet'; check('calendar path missing', 'BTC', context_slice(pr2, t, 3600, 21), tl=3600, ti=60)\nos.environ['SYNTH_BENCHMARK_SEED'] = 'abc'; check('non-int seed', 'BTC', context_slice(pr2, t, 3600, 21), tl=3600, ti=60)\nEOF","description":"Robustness checks of simulate on degraded contexts","timeout":300000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":684,"cache_read_input_tokens":416174,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":684,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0c085d9a-8c1d-4329-8588-fab9897b1131","uuid":"24dcba9e-da6e-4bd1-bebe-bd0508a9fd41","timestamp":"2026-11-10T17:14:13.840Z"}
