 the next (XAU Saturday 5-min rms\n0.15-4 bp), far more than weekday levels, so weekend steps need their own, wider per-path\nvariance factor (stratified log-normal, mean 1) on top of the common one.\nResult (we_mix_sd 0.5 / 0.8, all assets; A / B / C):\n  com-equ: 0.5 -> -0.04% (8/8) / -0.02% (4/8) / -0.05% (8/8); 0.8 -> -0.08 (7/8) / -0.04 (3/8) /\n  -0.11% (8/8). crypto-24h: 0.5 -> -0.02 (3/5) / -0.02 (5/5) / -0.10% (5/5); 0.8 -> +0.01 /\n  0.00 / -0.21%. Verdict: keep, 0.5 for crypto and 0.8 for the equity/commodity perps (24h only;\n  1h untested -> off). v8.\nEOF\ngit add -A; git commit -qm \"v8: weekend-specific per-path variance dispersion (24h)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\"; git log --oneline | head -1\ncat > /tmp/off24.sh <<'EOF'\ncd /workspace\nOUT=agent/research/official/champion_v8; mkdir -p $OUT\nrun() { uv run agent/predict.py --asset $1 --days 10 --eval-end 2026-11-08 > $OUT/$2_$1.log 2>&1; }\nfor a in BTC ETH SOL XRP HYPE; do run $a crypto-24h & done; wait\nfor a in XAU NVDAX GOOGLX TSLAX AAPLX WTIOIL SPCX SP500; do run $a com-equ-24h & done; wait\nEOF\nnohup bash /tmp/off24.sh > /dev/null 2>&1 & echo launched","description":"Adopt v8 weekend dispersion; commit; launch official 24h eval","timeout":300000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":423394,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":423394,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0c085d9a-8c1d-4329-8588-fab9897b1131","uuid":"26476f90-e762-4c95-a34f-c3af805c0959","timestamp":"2026-11-10T17:31:37.842Z"}
